										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-109141 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>Even though the brand-new 21065 Architecture Sagrada Familia LEGO set has only been released for a matter of days at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>), it’s already out of stock in US and Canada. Despite a staggering $799 USD / $1099.99 CAD price tag, LEGO fans clearly wanted the opportunity to build their own version of the tallest church in the world, which resides in Barcelona, Spain.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-109148 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-4.jpg" alt="" width="800" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-4.jpg 800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-4-200x300.jpg 200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-4-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-4-768x1152.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /></p>
<p data-id="HmmFx0">While the LEGO set pales in comparison to the real thing, as far as LEGO sets go, it’s among the largest. Not only does it contain a record-breaking 12,060 pieces in the set, but it also stands 25 inches tall, 19 inches wide, and 16 inches deep when it’s assembled.</p>
<p data-id="fxUl3x">Let’s take a closer look at this set and why it should come as no surprise that it sold out so fast, even with how expensive it is.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p data-id="fxUl3x"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-109154 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-10.jpg" alt="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-10.jpg 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-10-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-10-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-10-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<h3>The Beauty is in the Details</h3>
<p>The first thing you notice when you look at this assembled model is how impressive it is. It’s full of amazing details, such as the numerous bell towers, the facades, and even the wings on the spires. But perhaps the most exciting of all is the stained-glass effect on the windows, which LEGO achieved with multicolored and transparent bricks and pieces. Everywhere you look, there’s another element that catches your eye and draws you in.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-109146 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Product-Image-3.jpg" alt="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Product-Image-3.jpg 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Product-Image-3-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Product-Image-3-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Product-Image-3-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>All of these details come together into a stunning and structurally advanced replica of the church, which is currently still under construction, and has been since 1882. It’s a wonderful set for history lovers, travelers, or anyone who appreciates timeless architecture.</p>
<p>With so many pieces and details to put together, this set is certainly a challenge to build, but the journey is rewarding at the same time. Once you’re done, you’re left with a stunning display piece that’s sure to start plenty of conversations no matter where you place it.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-109157 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="997" height="1061" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 1128w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-282x300.png 282w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-963x1024.png 963w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x817.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 997px) 100vw, 997px" /></p>
<h3>A Step-By-Step Recreation of The Real Thing</h3>
<p>Instead of being a layer-by-layer build, the build process for this set is inspired by the actual construction of the Sagrada Familia. Builders get to follow along with the real-life progression of the project, starting with the apse and crypt, and finishing with the Eastern Sacristy and the Glory facade.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-109142 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle.jpg" alt="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle.jpg 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>This process gives builders a deeper connection to this iconic Spanish landmark, which was designed by the late Antoni Gaudí, who passed away 100 years ago, in 1926.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-109141 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p><em>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks as we regularly update and inform all of our readers of the latest LEGO Promotions, GWP and Sales &amp; Deals.</em></p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
