<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-72252 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/18-LEGO-Creator-Expert-Botanical-Collection-10309-Succulents-May-2022-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="920" height="762" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/18-LEGO-Creator-Expert-Botanical-Collection-10309-Succulents-May-2022-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 920w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/18-LEGO-Creator-Expert-Botanical-Collection-10309-Succulents-May-2022-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x248.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/18-LEGO-Creator-Expert-Botanical-Collection-10309-Succulents-May-2022-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x636.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 920px) 100vw, 920px" /><br />
9. LEGO City Yellow Backhoe Loader 60480 &#8211; <strong>20% off</strong> (Regular $29.99, on sale for <strong>$23.95</strong>)</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now at Official Site:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113326 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-City-Yellow-Backhoe-Loader-60480-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="1028" height="1001" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-City-Yellow-Backhoe-Loader-60480-Front-Box.jpg 1500w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-City-Yellow-Backhoe-Loader-60480-Front-Box-300x292.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-City-Yellow-Backhoe-Loader-60480-Front-Box-1024x997.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-City-Yellow-Backhoe-Loader-60480-Front-Box-768x748.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1028px) 100vw, 1028px" /></p>
<p>10. LEGO Harry Potter Hogwarts Castle and Grounds 76419 &#8211;<strong> 19% off</strong> (Regular $169.99, on sale for <strong>$136.99</strong>)</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now at Official Site:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-83116 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76419-Hogwarts-Castle-and-Grounds-September-2023-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="965" height="875" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76419-Hogwarts-Castle-and-Grounds-September-2023-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 965w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76419-Hogwarts-Castle-and-Grounds-September-2023-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x272.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76419-Hogwarts-Castle-and-Grounds-September-2023-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x696.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 965px) 100vw, 965px" /></p>
<p>Some of my favorite deals include the Hogwarts Castle and Grounds for its great attention to detail, as well as the Yellow Backhoe Loader for all the accessories it comes with. I also like the Mercedes set, as the vehicles have design details taken from their real-life versions. <strong>Shop Now at Official Site:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-83114 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76419-Hogwarts-Castle-and-Grounds-September-2023-Release-Date-Aerial-Top-View.jpg" alt="" width="1112" height="891" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76419-Hogwarts-Castle-and-Grounds-September-2023-Release-Date-Aerial-Top-View.jpg 1112w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76419-Hogwarts-Castle-and-Grounds-September-2023-Release-Date-Aerial-Top-View-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76419-Hogwarts-Castle-and-Grounds-September-2023-Release-Date-Aerial-Top-View-1024x820.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76419-Hogwarts-Castle-and-Grounds-September-2023-Release-Date-Aerial-Top-View-768x615.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1112px) 100vw, 1112px" /></p>
<p>For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/forum/17-general-lego-sales-deals-forum-members-only/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>For the Amazon LEGO 2026 Deals, check it out right here:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/4dYMzLn" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/40WwLo0">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3TkFHyh" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3V3vjwl">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/4jKQPPG" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3Ofv2CG">Amazon UK</a></p>
<p><strong>For Amazon LEGO Bestsellers List, check it out right here:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx">Amazon UK</a></p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
