					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1200" height="1200" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO 11390 Dragon Ball Shenron &amp; Goku Icons November 2026 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>Two all-new 18+ LEGO Icons sets are now officially available for purchase at LEGO (USA &#124; Canada &#124;</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-venetian-neighborhood-and-dragon-ball-shenron-goku-sets-now-officially-released-to-general-public-free-gwp-gift-with-purchase-promo/">LEGO Venetian Neighborhood and Dragon Ball: Shenron &#038; Goku Sets Now Officially Released to General Public (Free GWP Gift with Purchase Promo)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Two all-new 18+ LEGO Icons sets are now officially available for purchase at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). These include 11388 Venetian Neighborhood and 11390 Dragon Ball: Shenron &amp; Goku. Insiders got early access to purchase the set from November 1-3, 2026 while the official release date is on November 4, 2026.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113603 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="848" height="848" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 848px) 100vw, 848px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-113610 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures.png" alt="" width="1200" height="675" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures-300x169.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures-1024x576.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures-768x432.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113620 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="797" height="778" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x293.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-1024x999.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x749.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 797px) 100vw, 797px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-113021 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
