					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1200" height="1200" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Fortnite-77080-Supply-Drop-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Fortnite 77080 Supply Drop Summer June 2026 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Fortnite-77080-Supply-Drop-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Fortnite-77080-Supply-Drop-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Fortnite-77080-Supply-Drop-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Fortnite-77080-Supply-Drop-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Fortnite-77080-Supply-Drop-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>Good Evening LEGO Fans! Amazon US currently has some LEGO deals for tonight. Free shipping on orders above</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/8-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-tonight-november-2-2026/">8 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for Tonight, November 2, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Good Evening LEGO Fans! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for tonight. Free shipping on orders above $35.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-96579 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76452-Quality-Quidditch-Supplies-Ice-Cream-Parlour-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="928" height="720" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76452-Quality-Quidditch-Supplies-Ice-Cream-Parlour-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 928w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76452-Quality-Quidditch-Supplies-Ice-Cream-Parlour-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x233.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76452-Quality-Quidditch-Supplies-Ice-Cream-Parlour-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x596.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 928px) 100vw, 928px" /></p>
<p>Our top picks include <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Fortnite-Supply-Drop-Building/dp/B0G2SSNHRW?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=7f3f51bf0a8b38d8f60345c2ac831444&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Fortnite Supply Drop 77080</a> at 20% off for<strong> $35.97</strong> (reg.$44.99) and <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Quality-Quidditch-Supplies-Parlour/dp/B0DRW5JF3H?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=e3a191441ca54d77f7b9fc9314755e8e&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Harry Potter Quality Quidditch Supplies &amp; Ice Cream Parlour 76452</a> at 20% off for <strong>$79.96</strong> (reg.$99.99).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-107684 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Fortnite-77080-Supply-Drop-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="723" height="904" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Fortnite-77080-Supply-Drop-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 960w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Fortnite-77080-Supply-Drop-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-240x300.png 240w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Fortnite-77080-Supply-Drop-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-819x1024.png 819w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Fortnite-77080-Supply-Drop-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x960.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 723px) 100vw, 723px" /></p>
<p>Below are 8 of our handpicked best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Tonight, November 2, 2026. Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don&#8217;t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3>8 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Tonight, November 2, 2026</h3>
<ul>
<li>30% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-City-Rides-Firefighter-Minifigure/dp/B0FMS97LHY?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=3ee2698628c98db88481b124e13c240a&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO City Rides &#8211; Fire Truck 60482</a> <strong>$6.99</strong> (reg.$9.99)</li>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Harry-Potter-Hogwarts-Castle/dp/B0DRW5H79H?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=da9ae04cf4bc6c1774156471cf3fc4bb&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Harry Potter Hogwarts Castle: Herbology Class 76445</a><strong> $39.97</strong> (reg.$49.99)</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-96587 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76445-Hogwarts-Castle-Herbology-Class-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="856" height="859" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76445-Hogwarts-Castle-Herbology-Class-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 856w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76445-Hogwarts-Castle-Herbology-Class-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76445-Hogwarts-Castle-Herbology-Class-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76445-Hogwarts-Castle-Herbology-Class-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x771.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 856px) 100vw, 856px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-103323 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/60482-Rides-–-Fire-Truck-1.jpg" alt="" width="837" height="836" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/60482-Rides-–-Fire-Truck-1.jpg 837w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/60482-Rides-–-Fire-Truck-1-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/60482-Rides-–-Fire-Truck-1-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/60482-Rides-–-Fire-Truck-1-768x767.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 837px) 100vw, 837px" /></p>
<ul>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Fortnite-Supply-Drop-Building/dp/B0G2SSNHRW?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=7f3f51bf0a8b38d8f60345c2ac831444&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Fortnite Supply Drop 77080</a><strong> $35.97</strong> (reg.$44.99)</li>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Quality-Quidditch-Supplies-Parlour/dp/B0DRW5JF3H?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=e3a191441ca54d77f7b9fc9314755e8e&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Harry Potter Quality Quidditch Supplies &amp; Ice Cream Parlour 76452</a> <strong>$79.96</strong> (reg.$99.99)</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-96578 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76452-Quality-Quidditch-Supplies-Ice-Cream-Parlour-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="894" height="872" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76452-Quality-Quidditch-Supplies-Ice-Cream-Parlour-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 894w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76452-Quality-Quidditch-Supplies-Ice-Cream-Parlour-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x293.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76452-Quality-Quidditch-Supplies-Ice-Cream-Parlour-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x749.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 894px) 100vw, 894px" /></p>
