					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="831" height="821" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/60491-Motorcycle-Transporter-1.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="60491 Motorcycle Transporter 1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/60491-Motorcycle-Transporter-1.jpg 831w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/60491-Motorcycle-Transporter-1-300x296.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/60491-Motorcycle-Transporter-1-768x759.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 831px) 100vw, 831px" /></p>
<p>Good Late Monday Evening Canadian LEGO Fans! Amazon Canada has a few LEGO deals for this evening. Free</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/8-handpicked-best-amazon-canada-lego-deals-sales-list-for-tonight-november-2-2026/">8 Handpicked Best Amazon Canada LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for Tonight, November 2, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Good Late Monday Evening Canadian LEGO Fans! <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> has a few LEGO deals for this evening. Free shipping on orders above $35 CAD.</p>
<p>Below are 8 of our Handpicked Best Amazon Canada LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Tonight, November 2, 2026.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3>8 Handpicked Best Amazon Canada LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Tonight, November 2, 2026</h3>
<ul>
<li>30% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/LEGO-Minecraft-Creeper-Kids-Toy/dp/B0DRW8231P?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=fe250da05488702224e7905b335e338c&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Minecraft The Creeper 21276</a> <strong>$35.12</strong> (reg.$49.99)</li>
<li>27% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/LEGO-Speed-Champions-Porsche-Super/dp/B0DRW5TL43?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=103ede3c09508eaf21022062af9b8e39&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Speed Champions Porsche 911 GT3 RS Super Car 77239</a> <strong>$25.52</strong> (reg.$34.99)</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-96506 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77239-Porsche-911-GT3-RS-Super-Car-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="912" height="602" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77239-Porsche-911-GT3-RS-Super-Car-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 912w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77239-Porsche-911-GT3-RS-Super-Car-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x198.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77239-Porsche-911-GT3-RS-Super-Car-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x507.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 912px) 100vw, 912px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-96722 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Minecraft-21276-The-Creeper-Summer-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="665" height="659" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Minecraft-21276-The-Creeper-Summer-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 864w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Minecraft-21276-The-Creeper-Summer-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x297.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Minecraft-21276-The-Creeper-Summer-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Minecraft-21276-The-Creeper-Summer-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x761.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 665px) 100vw, 665px" /></p>
<ul>
<li>28% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/LEGO-Creator-Fierce-Dinosaur-Building/dp/B0FMS9Q3LT?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=03fdb40364aade8f33b4ad181e660008&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Creator 3in1 Fierce Dinosaur 31379</a> <strong>$18.03</strong> (reg.$24.99)</li>
<li>23% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/LEGO-Marvel-Spider-Man-vs-Mysterio/dp/B0FMS6YHHV?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=9a60e1ec4f02c616ab5959ac73e74db2&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Marvel Spider-Man vs. Mysterio: The Daily Bugle 76342</a> <strong>$99.98</strong> (reg.$129.99) &#8211; <em>Actual regular retail price is $129.99 at <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Canada</a> even though Amazon has a lower regular price</em></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-103024 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31379-Fierce-Dinosaur-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="837" height="820" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31379-Fierce-Dinosaur-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 837w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31379-Fierce-Dinosaur-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x294.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31379-Fierce-Dinosaur-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x752.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 837px) 100vw, 837px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-101626 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Marvel-76342-Spider-Man-vs.-Mysterio-The-Daily-Bugle-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="885" height="871" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Marvel-76342-Spider-Man-vs.-Mysterio-The-Daily-Bugle-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 885w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Marvel-76342-Spider-Man-vs.-Mysterio-The-Daily-Bugle-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x295.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Marvel-76342-Spider-Man-vs.-Mysterio-The-Daily-Bugle-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x756.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 885px) 100vw, 885px" /></p>
