										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114100 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Technic-42254-Solar-System-Planets-in-Orbit-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Technic-42254-Solar-System-Planets-in-Orbit-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Technic-42254-Solar-System-Planets-in-Orbit-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Technic-42254-Solar-System-Planets-in-Orbit-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Technic-42254-Solar-System-Planets-in-Orbit-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Technic-42254-Solar-System-Planets-in-Orbit-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>A new upcoming LEGO Technic January 2027 set has been revealed LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). We&#8217;ll look at details for 42254 Solar System Planets in Orbit including US/Canada prices, release dates, set images and more.</p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks and we&#8217;ll let you know when Technic 42254 Solar System Planets in Orbit becomes available!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<ul>
<li>LEGO Technic 42254 Solar System Planets in Orbit</li>
